OL,3,GNEWSAI'm carrying a boulder for a 100
OL,4,Adays to symbolise men's struggles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 25kg boulder might seem an unusual
OL,7,Fcompanion for a daily walk, but for
OL,8,FSteve Marshall it has become a powerful
OL,9,Fsymbol of the burdens men carry through
OL,10,Flife.
OL,12,FSteve, from Telford, is carrying the
OL,13,Frock on his shoulder for a 100 days to
OL,14,Fraise awareness of men's mental health
OL,15,Fand raise money for charity.
OL,17,FHe carried the boulder to the top of
OL,18,FThe Wrekin on Saturday as part of the
OL,19,Fchallenge, marking his 45th day of the
OL,20,Fchallenge.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
